Criterion 2 of #15. For a period of a run (default the whole run; for example the hindcast's Tsubouchi year), the
time-mean T and S of each column against WOA23's decade 2005–2014 (A5B4, annual, 1°, downloaded once from NCEI and
interpolated onto the model's columns): AW core temperature, salinity and depth (maximum between 100 and 1500 m), the
0 °C bounds above and below, thickness and heat content relative to 0 °C, by region (Nordic Seas, Fram Strait, Eurasian
Basin, Amerasian north of 82°N, Canada Basin, all deep basins). Table atlantic_water_<from>_<to>.md, region-mean T and S
profiles, maps of core temperature and depth. CPU only.

